  "subTitleDesc": null,
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "水利工程與資源保育概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO  WATER  RESOURCES  ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": " 台灣在水利工程上的進程，已由過去僅偏重工程防禦轉為工程措施與水資源管理並重，故目前的水利政策為「利水」、「保水」、「治水」、「親水」與「活水」並進。本課程將涵蓋此四大面向進行說明，並由台灣案例和國際文獻案例中，使學生更能瞭解專業領域所包含的面向。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to introduce the inter-disciplinary and developing science for the students to match the increasing demands from public sectors in Taiwan.  The basic concepts of ecology and ecological engineering are first introduced and followed by four fields of application, including, stream, slope land, urban, and road on their problems and the planning, design, and implementation of ecological engineering methods.  Practical cases and issue of water quality are finally discussed to illustrate the whole picture of this subject.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解本系特色及畢業生就業關聯",
      "describe_en": "\t1. Students can understand the characteristics of this department and possible career options after graduation."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": " 認識當代議題、瞭解題台灣水資源環境特色與因應對策",
      "describe_en": "\t2. Students can recognize the modern issues and describe the characteristics of Taiwan's water resources environment and their counter strategies."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "認知水利工程師之社會、環境責任及專業倫理",
      "describe_en": "3. Students can recognize the social and environmental responsibilities and professional ethics of a hydraulic engineer."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "能夠在分組討論與作業中表現有效溝通及團隊合作的能力。",
      "describe_en": "4. Students can apply their abilities of effective communication and teamwork in group discussions and assignments."
    }
  ],
